    "## `pd.pivot` — Long → Wide\n",
    "\n",
    "`pd.pivot` converts a long DataFrame back to a wide DataFrame. Its key arguments are:\n",
    "\n",
    "- `index` — column to use as row identifiers.\n",
    "- `columns` — column whose values become the new column names.\n",
    "- `values` — column whose values fill the cells."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 14,
   "id": "710ea84b",
